This repository contains source definitions: data describing how to read public
websites, plus a small number of Python hooks for sites that cannot be described
as data alone.

Nothing here is derived from the GPL-3.0-or-later code of
https://github.com/lncrawl/lightnovel-crawler. Definitions and hooks are written
against the observable behaviour of each website. Where a hook implements a
site's own scheme, such as a content encoding or a request signature, it
reimplements that scheme rather than adapting existing code.
